WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.118
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:10.119 --> 00:00:14.142
I'm a great blue heron.

3
00:00:14.143 --> 00:00:18.068
Herons are waders.

4
00:00:18.069 --> 00:00:23.260
Those are birds that stay near shallow water.

5
00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:26.092
Where do you live?

6
00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:31.380
Great blue herons live in North America.

7
00:00:31.381 --> 00:00:38.159
We like rivers, ponds, marshes, and fields.

8
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.161
What do you eat?

9
00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:47.117
We eat insects, mice, and even snakes.

10
00:00:47.118 --> 00:00:51.977
But we like fish best of all.

11
00:00:51.978 --> 00:00:55.226
How do you catch fish?

12
00:00:55.227 --> 00:01:01.872
We stand in the water without moving.

13
00:01:01.873 --> 00:01:06.752
We wait for fish to swim by.

14
00:01:06.753 --> 00:01:19.427
Then we use our sharp bills as spears.

15
00:01:19.428 --> 00:01:22.430
Do you lay eggs?

16
00:01:22.431 --> 00:01:27.316
We lay about five eggs at a time.

17
00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:32.323
We keep them in nests in high trees.

18
00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:35.531
Who are your enemies?

19
00:01:35.532 --> 00:01:39.721
We don't have many enemies.

20
00:01:39.722 --> 00:01:48.370
But raccoons and eagles sometimes eat young herons.

21
00:01:48.371 --> 00:01:54.135
You have really long legs.

22
00:01:54.136 --> 00:01:58.295
We have big wings too.

23
00:01:58.296 --> 00:02:04.826
We can spread them very wide.

24
00:02:04.827 --> 00:02:11.800
See? I look like a dinosaur in the sky!

25
00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:20.054
Good-bye, Great Blue Heron!

